@startuml seq-assign
!theme plain
actor Avocat
participant "API LexHub" as API
database Base
participant "Temps réel" as RT
actor Assistant

Avocat -> API : valider ou assigner
API -> Base : statut = validated
API -> Base : assigned_to (optionnel)
API -> RT : événement WebSocket
RT --> Assistant : rafraîchir liste
API --> Assistant : notification / e-mail
Assistant -> API : export / impression
@enduml
